title: "Virtual Radiosonde Plotter: Atmospheric Sounding Analysis & Skew-T Visualization Tool"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-09-12
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/widhyatma/Radiosonde"
keywords:
  - meteorology
  - radiosonde
  - skew-t
  - metpy
  - severe-weather
  - open-meteo
  - atmospheric-sounding
abstract: >-
  A professional desktop application for downloading atmospheric weather model profiles (Open-Meteo ERA5 / Forecast),
  performing MetPy thermodynamic calculations (CAPE, CIN, PWAT, LCL, LFC, EL), generating publication-quality Skew-T Log-P diagrams,
  and exporting data to CSV and native RAOB (.rsf, .env) software formats.
